sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  actor OP as Operator
  participant UI as Storefront
  participant O as Orders
  participant F as Fulfillment
  participant I as Inventory
  participant R as Reviews
  participant S as Support
  OP->>UI: Advance shipment with revision + operation ID
  UI->>F: Operator transition
  C->>UI: Open owned order
  UI->>O: Tracking query with customer token
  O->>F: Shipment state with worker identity
  F-->>O: Authoritative synthetic tracking
  O-->>UI: Owner-scoped tracking
  C->>R: Review delivered SKU
  R->>O: Verify owned delivered purchase
  OP->>R: Moderate with reason
  C->>S: Create/reply to ticket
  S->>O: Verify optional linked order ownership
  OP->>S: Reply/update status with audit
  OP->>I: Inspect all returned units
  I->>I: Restock SELLABLE units only
